  "changes": [],
  "analysis": "No shared change is sufficiently supported. Across three development scenes, the chaise retains major silhouette and crop errors, the bunk room has misplaced overhead features and a dark lamp underside, and the classroom has close board bounds but incorrect wipe patterns. The classroom audit confirms distinct procedural materials, rejecting the suspected assignment failure. The bunk audit confirms zero diffuser emission, but does not separate its visible effect from shade occlusion, placement, or illumination. These findings support different local corrections, not a universal lighting adjustment. Existing H guidance already covers contour, coverage, and appearance review; further general instructions have no demonstrated advantage here. Retain current H/M without claiming improvement.",
